ally offers financial support to all students accepted into the Ph.D. program. Teaching assistantships and research assistantships are available, and most new doctoral students begin as teaching assistants. The duties associated with a teaching assistantship vary and may include instruction of undergraduate laboratories, grading, and laboratory experiment preparation. Research assistantships are offered by many faculty members and are available to continuing doctoral students. The department also usually has fellowships available through the Louisiana State Board of Regents. All financial support of graduate students is contingent upon available funding.\nGraduate School Master's Scholarship\nNext Steps\nHow to Apply\nFinancial Support\nApply to LSU New Orleans\nFooter\nContact\n2000 Lakeshore Drive New Orleans, LA 70148\n[email protected]\n[email protected]\n+1 (888) 514-4275\n+1 (888) 514-4275\n+1 (504) 384-7924\n+1 (504) 384-7924\nLearn\nAdmission information\nPrograms of study\nScholarships and awards\nTuition and fees\nGraduate programs\nFinancial aid\nImportant dates & deadlines\nExperience\nInternational center\nOur campus\nStudent life\nHousing\nCareer services\nAlumni\nMake a gift\nAnnual Security Report\nConnect\nAll social\nUniversity calendar\nNews\nFor parents\nEspanol - Tieng Viet\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nNon-Discrimination\nTitle IX\nCampus Crime\nEmergency Preparedness\n\u00a9 2026 LSU New Orleans. All Rights Reserved.", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://www.lsuneworleans.edu/academics/cos/chemistry/graduate/financial-support#main"], ["", "https://www.lsuneworleans.edu/"], ["", "https://www.lsuneworleans.edu/admissions"], ["Admissions", "https://www.lsuneworleans.edu/admissions"], ["Undergraduate Admissions", "https://www.lsuneworleans.edu/admissions/apply-freshman"], ["Transfer Admissions", "https://www.lsuneworleans.edu/admissions/transfer"], ["Adult Learners", "https://www.lsuneworleans.edu/admissions/adult-learners"], ["Military 